{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heptic Arena</strong> is a Third Person PvPvE Showdown Shooter set within an intergalactic game show that features four unique biomes filled with monsters and hazards as you fight to emerge victorious in a colosseum-style arena finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/fb1b27fb26d9106b3485e4a9344c9213.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/fb1b27fb26d9106b3485e4a9344c9213.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a contender in the illustrious Arena and participate in the only blood sport televised across the known universe. Each episode will pit you and your friends not only against other contenders, but the whims of the organizers as well. Explore, upgrade your arsenal, shoot opponents, shoot your friends \u2013 do whatever it takes to become the champion of Heptic Arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/321942435092c93c3d35330e3e02c9bf.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/321942435092c93c3d35330e3e02c9bf.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to mimic the home environments of the contenders, The Arena features four unique biomes \u2013 each with its own boons, challenges, and hyper-aggressive fauna. Team up or brave the wilds alone, but know there are scarier things than players hiding in The Arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/6c1257b0e7a1e278148b03cecb713462.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/6c1257b0e7a1e278148b03cecb713462.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from four galactic species participating in the Arena, each allowing for a different approach to combat with their unique skill sets. Shape your characters your way with branching skill trees, active skills, and unique passive bonuses to keep your enemies guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/62bcdadfaa052dfbb947054a34615f1f.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/62bcdadfaa052dfbb947054a34615f1f.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom around the battlefield using a momentum-based movement system, opening up new opportunities and pathways around both the map and your foes. Learn the ropes, discover pathways, and show your mastery of the Arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/712f3dd80ced91be3859d8ceac8f08b4.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/712f3dd80ced91be3859d8ceac8f08b4.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill and steal your way into the hearts of millions. Each kill earns favor with the audience that can be spent to purchase new weapons, upgrades, and other goodies tailored to help you do what you do best \u2013 sow chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/d8eee993dc7baacb2844b1f770930c5c.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/d8eee993dc7baacb2844b1f770930c5c.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2707850?t=1772018422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/844e50672f68996b2b4394eb9debb13d151a9aa5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772018422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/3f33467e4ee8d70f044bd6fdaf47f748dcefced1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772018422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/3f33467e4ee8d70f044bd6fdaf47f748dcefced1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772018422","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>CLOSED PLAYTEST SIGNUPS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/b0b656ec603f0911b1e2bb064cef958d.avif?t=1772018422\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/994b08e1148ff267f9dfa31644ae5d55.avif?t=1772018422\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heptic Arena</strong> is a Third Person PvPvE Showdown Shooter set within an intergalactic game show that features four unique biomes filled with monsters and hazards as you fight to emerge victorious in a colosseum-style arena finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/fb1b27fb26d9106b3485e4a9344c9213.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/fb1b27fb26d9106b3485e4a9344c9213.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a contender in the illustrious Arena and participate in the only blood sport televised across the known universe. Each episode will pit you and your friends not only against other contenders, but the whims of the organizers as well. Explore, upgrade your arsenal, shoot opponents, shoot your friends \u2013 do whatever it takes to become the champion of Heptic Arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/321942435092c93c3d35330e3e02c9bf.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/321942435092c93c3d35330e3e02c9bf.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to mimic the home environments of the contenders, The Arena features four unique biomes \u2013 each with its own boons, challenges, and hyper-aggressive fauna. Team up or brave the wilds alone, but know there are scarier things than players hiding in The Arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/6c1257b0e7a1e278148b03cecb713462.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/6c1257b0e7a1e278148b03cecb713462.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from four galactic species participating in the Arena, each allowing for a different approach to combat with their unique skill sets. Shape your characters your way with branching skill trees, active skills, and unique passive bonuses to keep your enemies guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/62bcdadfaa052dfbb947054a34615f1f.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/62bcdadfaa052dfbb947054a34615f1f.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom around the battlefield using a momentum-based movement system, opening up new opportunities and pathways around both the map and your foes. Learn the ropes, discover pathways, and show your mastery of the Arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/712f3dd80ced91be3859d8ceac8f08b4.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/712f3dd80ced91be3859d8ceac8f08b4.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill and steal your way into the hearts of millions. Each kill earns favor with the audience that can be spent to purchase new weapons, upgrades, and other goodies tailored to help you do what you do best \u2013 sow chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/d8eee993dc7baacb2844b1f770930c5c.poster.avif?t=1772018422\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/extras/d8eee993dc7baacb2844b1f770930c5c.webm?t=1772018422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Prism Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707850/45d5ce4c9a8a7e1da6f2c801a8f23d901257836a/header.jpg?t=1772018422","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Heptic\u2122 is a trademark of Prism Studio Limited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707850/438798770/33bc835df06cb83287c9a2988586346f2c911c80/1770661686/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770662089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707850/438798770/33bc835df06cb83287c9a2988586346f2c911c80/1770661686/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770662089","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707850/438798770/33bc835df06cb83287c9a2988586346f2c911c80/1770661686/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770662089","id":257283021,"name":"","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257283021/442d0c87d564de2b47af2f8fee188e53ad8d1840/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770662089"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707850/725103855/a696803cacbf8731264fd47390ad8ce3cb5cc045/1754996045/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770662090","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707850/725103855/a696803cacbf8731264fd47390ad8ce3cb5cc045/1754996045/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770662090","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707850/725103855/a696803cacbf8731264fd47390ad8ce3cb5cc045/1754996045/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770662090","